# The image needs server/, web/, and app/.
#
# app/ holds the new page. Its build stage needs the source, and web/js/
# holds the example character that the build reads, so both stay.
*
!server
!web
!app

# Nothing from these belongs in the image.
**/*_test.go
**/.DS_Store
server/magi-server

# These two must come after "!app": Docker uses the last pattern that
# matches. node_modules is not only large, it is wrong: esbuild and rollup
# carry a binary for one platform, and a copy from the host would replace
# the one that npm ci made inside the stage.
app/node_modules
app/dist
